From bb1493e74352f889a30dec852c178a8ae591e0e6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ashfordeOU <236818772+ashfordeOU@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 18:50:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] web/: the two tip-and-cue scenarios in the Studio library,
 with Studio links from their pages

The Studio library gains tip-and-cue-short and tip-and-cue-baltic-m2 (spaceops), recorded natively
and in the browser build, with a plain-language summary for the tip-and-cue kind (revisit, full-area
refresh, radio-to-optical reaction). The site's recorders re-run at this commit (only the commit and
timing fields move). i18n: studio-js.ftl regenerated for the seven new Studio strings; the three
pages whose build stamp moved re-extracted, translations renumbered and migrated.
