-<!-- seo:body --><noscript><section class="crawl-text"><h1>Kshana Studio</h1><p>Kshana Studio runs Kshana, the open-source PNT (positioning, navigation and timing) resilience simulator, in your browser: the engine runs locally as WebAssembly, so nothing is installed and nothing is uploaded. Pick a GNSS (global navigation satellite system) jamming, spoofing, clock holdover, integrity or lunar navigation scenario, tune it, replay it, compare runs, sweep a parameter and download a reproducible report. It needs JavaScript.</p><h2>Scenarios it runs (183)</h2><ul><li><a href="/studio/?scenario=acm-link&amp;tab=overview">acm-link</a>: DVB-S2 adaptive coding and modulation (ACM) along one satellite&#x27;s passes over one station.</li><li><a href="/studio/?scenario=aocs-slew&amp;tab=overview">aocs-slew</a>: Reaction-wheel attitude slew under MRP feedback, closed on the true state.</li><li><a href="/studio/?scenario=aocs-slew-mekf&amp;tab=overview">aocs-slew-mekf</a>: Reaction-wheel attitude slew under MRP feedback, closed on an MEKF estimate.</li><li><a href="/studio/?scenario=aperture-duty-cycle&amp;tab=overview">aperture-duty-cycle</a>: Aperture duty-cycle demonstrator (ground segment &amp; operations).</li><li><a href="/studio/?scenario=araim-gps-galileo&amp;tab=timeseries">araim-gps-galileo</a>: Dual-constellation ARAIM availability: GPS + Galileo evaluated with the advanced</li><li><a href="/studio/?scenario=araim-reference-check&amp;tab=overview">araim-reference-check</a>: The engine&#x27;s ARAIM protection levels against the WG-C subgroup&#x27;s OWN worked examples.</li><li><a href="/studio/?scenario=ascent-losses&amp;tab=overview">ascent-losses</a>: Gravity-turn ascent losses of an ILLUSTRATIVE two-stage kerosene/oxygen launcher (no real</li><li><a href="/studio/?scenario=attitude-budget&amp;tab=overview">attitude-budget</a>: 3-DOF attitude &amp; pointing error budget demonstrator (pre-hardware AOCS/GNC).</li><li><a href="/studio/?scenario=automotive-urban-canyon&am